+		<Tag>TXT_KEY_IMPROVEMENT_CITY_RUINS_PEDIA</Tag>
+		<English>[TAB]Ruins are the remains of human-made architecture: structures that were once complete, as time went by, have fallen into a state of partial or complete disrepair, due to lack of maintenance or deliberate acts of destruction. Disasters, war and depopulation are the most common root causes, with many structures becoming progressively derelict over time due to long-term weathering and scavenging.</English>
